  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"avSPX\" id=\"avSPX\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u439d947f\" id=\"u439d947f\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">foreach函数</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uf5203359\" id=\"uf5203359\"><code data-lake-id=\"u0f599c8f\" id=\"u0f599c8f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u96701a45\" id=\"u96701a45\">foreach</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u23870e7f\" id=\"u23870e7f\"> 函数在 Makefile 中用于对一个列表中的每个元素执行一个给定的操作 ,语法如下:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%24(foreach%20var%2Clist%2Ctext)%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dy43t%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9bf28ced\" id=\"u9bf28ced\"><span data-lake-id=\"udbed3bbb\" id=\"udbed3bbb\">实例:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22A%20%3D%20a%20b%20c%5CnB%20%3D%20%24(foreach%20f%2C%20%24(A)%2C%20%24(f).o)%5Cn%5Cnall%3A%5Cn%5Ct%40echo%20B%20%3D%20%24(B)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y0mCN%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ubd431d3d\" id=\"ubd431d3d\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua027ab90\" id=\"ua027ab90\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d8997a7\" id=\"u0d8997a7\">foreach</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9783d20f\" id=\"u9783d20f\"> 函数会遍历变量 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4d32172c\" id=\"u4d32172c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u32fcb464\" id=\"u32fcb464\">A</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6e286a07\" id=\"u6e286a07\"> 中的每个元素（</span><code data-lake-id=\"u95030d5c\" id=\"u95030d5c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u140d6a1c\" id=\"u140d6a1c\">a</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u57eba342\" id=\"u57eba342\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2cfc2308\" id=\"u2cfc2308\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5736327b\" id=\"u5736327b\">b</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc39e0467\" id=\"uc39e0467\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud29bf72d\" id=\"ud29bf72d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4edb267\" id=\"uc4edb267\">c</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue892d773\" id=\"ue892d773\">），并对每个元素执行操作 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ucb6b7ccf\" id=\"ucb6b7ccf\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf26e5efc\" id=\"uf26e5efc\">$(f).o</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7cebb53a\" id=\"u7cebb53a\">，生成 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ufb2a8357\" id=\"ufb2a8357\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8bb0a12d\" id=\"u8bb0a12d\">a.o b.o c.o</span></code></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"uwN51\" id=\"uwN51\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4cc8480a\" id=\"u4cc8480a\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">filter/filter-out函数</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ue674e971\" id=\"ue674e971\"><code data-lake-id=\"u85252988\" id=\"u85252988\"><span data-lake-id=\"u99081286\" id=\"u99081286\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">filter</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uaa7054a1\" id=\"uaa7054a1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u53d1fd0d\" id=\"u53d1fd0d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4c419fa\" id=\"ud4c419fa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">filter-out</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u70ebd90a\" id=\"u70ebd90a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 函数用于从一个列表中过滤出或排除特定的元素,语法如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%24(filter%20pattern...%2Ctext)%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%9C%A8text%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%96%E5%87%BA%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88patten%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%5Cn%24(filter-out%20pattern...%2Ctext)%20%23%20%E5%9C%A8text%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%96%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%8D%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88patten%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P0sTC%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u8b0567f2\" id=\"u8b0567f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33111684\" id=\"u33111684\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">实例:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22C%20%3D%20a%20b%20c%20d%2F%5Cn%5CnD%20%3D%20%24(filter%20%25%2F%2C%20%24(C))%5CnE%20%3D%20%24(filter-out%20%25%2F%2C%20%24(C))%5Cn%5Cnall%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%40echo%20D%20%3D%20%24(D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%40echo%20E%20%3D%20%24(E)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L7fK9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"sWa7G\" id=\"sWa7G\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8eadfb80\" id=\"u8eadfb80\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Wildcard函数</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u1a5ef513\" id=\"u1a5ef513\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua59270d4\" id=\"ua59270d4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud2cec2ca\" id=\"ud2cec2ca\">wildcard</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u257ead19\" id=\"u257ead19\"> 函数用于查找匹配指定模式的文件,</span><span data-lake-id=\"u532a034f\" id=\"u532a034f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">语法如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%24(wildcard%20pattern)%20%23%20pattern%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%BA%86%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%90%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%2C%20wildcard%E5%8F%96%E5%87%BA%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NtjUp%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub7d6ec9b\" id=\"ub7d6ec9b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3ed4da9b\" id=\"u3ed4da9b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">实例:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5c2f4726\" id=\"u5c2f4726\"><span data-lake-id=\"u34459b88\" id=\"u34459b88\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">创建a.c b.c c.c文件</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22files%20%3D%20%24(wildcard%20*.c)%5Cn%5Cnall%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%40echo%20files%20%3D%20%24(files)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SNGNU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0f7ab558\" id=\"u0f7ab558\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10c3be97\" id=\"u10c3be97\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">判断真实存在的文件</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22files2%20%3D%20a.c%20b.c%20c.c%20d.c%20e.c%20%20abc%5Cnfiles3%20%3D%20%24(wildcard%20%24(files2))%5Cn%5Cnall%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%40echo%20files3%20%3D%20%24(files3)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pabD5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"vPWwV\" id=\"vPWwV\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6bff7de3\" id=\"u6bff7de3\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">patsubst函数</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u5c33744c\" id=\"u5c33744c\"><code data-lake-id=\"ueaccb856\" id=\"ueaccb856\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9f88f099\" id=\"u9f88f099\">patsubst</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4d6b4a9d\" id=\"u4d6b4a9d\"> 函数在 Makefile 中用于对字符串进行模式匹配和替换,语法如下:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%24(patsubst%20pattern%2Creplacement%2C%5C%5C%24(var))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WDeXk%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u00f81282\" id=\"u00f81282\"><span data-lake-id=\"u523e8cf4\" id=\"u523e8cf4\">实例:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22files2%20%20%3D%20a.c%20b.c%20c.c%20d.c%20e.c%20abc%5Cn%5Cndep_files%20%3D%20%24(patsubst%20%25.c%2C%25.d%2C%24(files2))%5Cn%5Cnall%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%40echo%20dep_files%20%3D%20%24(dep_files)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fLEkq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"zLL6y\" id=\"zLL6y\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba65caba\" id=\"uba65caba\">自定义函数</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u51d1bf41\" id=\"u51d1bf41\"><span data-lake-id=\"uee1ea892\" id=\"uee1ea892\">自定义函数格式如下:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22define%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%90%8D%5Cn%5Ct%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%5Cnendef%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZntVv%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><blockquote data-lake-id=\"ucf0ed574\" id=\"ucf0ed574\"><p data-lake-id=\"u04884e32\" id=\"u04884e32\"><span data-lake-id=\"u32563cea\" id=\"u32563cea\">可以使用$(0)  $(1)...获取函数参数,默认都会有一个参数</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"u07e3df59\" id=\"u07e3df59\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf0d2335c\" id=\"uf0d2335c\">调用格式如下:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%24(call%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%90%8D%2C%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B01%2C%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B02)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s5YrJ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud6a1dc90\" id=\"ud6a1dc90\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01e0a1d3\" id=\"u01e0a1d3\">实例:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22define%20func1%5Cn%5Ct%40echo%20My%20name%20is%20%24(0)%5Cnendef%5Cn%5Cndefine%20func2%5Cn%5Ct%40echo%20My%20name%20is%20%24(0)%20%24(1)%20%24(2)%5Cnendef%5Cn%5Cnall%3A%5Cn%5Ct%24(call%20func1)%5Cn%5Ct%24(call%20func2%2Chello%2C10)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolb